OL,3,GNEWSAStock car driver, 18, inspired by
OL,4,Adad in world bid
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenage driver believed to be the
OL,7,Fyoungest woman to qualify for a world
OL,8,Fstock car race title says she is
OL,9,Ffollowing in the footsteps of her
OL,10,Ftrophy-winning father.
OL,12,FBrooke Kitson, 18, from March in
OL,13,FCambridgeshire, was one of two female
OL,14,Fcompetitors to compete for the BriSCA
OL,15,FF1 Stock Car World Championships at
OL,16,FNorthampton's Shaleway track on
OL,17,FSaturday.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,375,370,200,160,0,100
