OL,3,GNEWSAStock car driver, 18, inspired by
OL,4,Adad in world bid
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said she was "gutted" she only
OL,7,Fmanaged three or four laps of the
OL,8,F25-lap race before a crash and a flat
OL,9,Ftyre ended her hopes, but it was a
OL,10,F"really great thing to be a part of".
OL,12,FThe driver said she had been inspired
OL,13,Fto compete in the male-dominated sport
OL,14,Fby her father, Daz Kitson, a former F2
OL,15,Fworld champion, who twice took the
OL,16,Ftitle.
